  <Docs>
    <summary>Describes the Vulkan device and function loader used to create a Graphite Vulkan context.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <format type="text/markdown"><![CDATA[
## Remarks

Populate the Vulkan handles and <xref:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteVkBackendContext.GetProcedureAddress> loader, then pass this object to <xref:SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteContext.CreateVulkan(SkiaSharp.SKGraphiteVkBackendContext)>. This type implements <xref:System.IDisposable>; you may dispose it once the context has been created.
]]></format>
    </remarks>
